        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">layer()</code> function page is missing a \"See also\" link to the page describing <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule_functions\" rel=\"nofollow\">at-rule functions</a>.</li>\n<li>The at-rule functions page is missing a \"See also\" link to the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule\" rel=\"nofollow\">at-rules</a> page.</li>\n</ul>",
