        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43868318?u=3f179cacfd70db40ae7c11f1b951533a8ebf45bf&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add documentation for DOMQuad.fromQuad()</li>\n<li>Add documentation for DOMQuad.fromRect()</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These static methods allow creating DOMQuad objects from quadrilateral coordinates or rectangle coordinates.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3499611477\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/230\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/project/issues/230/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/230\">openwebdocs/project#230</a></p>",
